# Ask arena_server for a safe point to drive to inside a named mission zone.
#
# Passive, like LocaliseInArena: reports a candidate now, does not drive there
# and does not verify a nav2 plan exists to it - the caller's own
# navigate_to_pose is what finds out whether the point is actually reachable.
#
# One message type shared by both /arena/request_excavation_waypoint and
# /arena/request_construction_waypoint - which zone is searched is fixed by
# which service you call, not a request field.

---
bool success
string message

# Chosen point, in the arena (map) frame. Only meaningful when success is true.
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped waypoint

# Costmap value (0-100) at the chosen point. -1 if use_costmap is false, in
# which case no safety check was made and waypoint is just the zone centre.
float64 cost

# Age of the costmap message this was scored against, in seconds. Large means
# global_traversability's update_period_s hasn't ticked in a while, so the
# point may not reflect the current terrain. 0 if use_costmap is false.
float64 costmap_age_s
